        BoldTrail, which used to be called kvCORE, is one of the biggest real estate platforms in the business. It bundles an IDX website, a smart CRM, lead generation, behavioural automation, transaction management, back office and recruiting, it includes IDX with no separate fee, and a large number of agents get it free through their brokerage. It is also sold on a quote only basis, with no published prices, no free trial and annual contracts as the default, and nothing in it answers a phone call or a WhatsApp message. BirkyStudio is a one-time build that answers your phone and WhatsApp 24/7 in English and Spanish, follows up automatically, and hands you prospects you own. Here is the honest breakdown, including the parts where BoldTrail is clearly the right buy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
