              <li>IDX consumer websites included with no separate IDX fee</li>
              <li>Behaviour triggered Smart Campaigns, AI lead scoring and HomeSearch AI</li>
              <li>Strong fit for teams and brokerages needing lead routing and dashboards</li>
              <li>Well regarded training library and onboarding resources</li>
              <li>Often free to the agent because the brokerage pays</li>
              <li>Large integration marketplace</li>
              <li>G2 4.5/5 from 1,561 reviews, Capterra 4.4/5 from 564</li>
            </ul>
