          <div>
            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Cons</p>
            <ul style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
              <li>No published pricing, the pricing link is a demo form</li>
              <li>No free trial and no free plan</li>
              <li>Annual contracts standard, reviewers report being held to the full term</li>
