              <li>Agent-reported costs around $499/mo, setup near $999, ad spend separate</li>
              <li>G2 reports 2 months to implement and 16 months to ROI on average</li>
              <li>Support and API limits flagged by independent reviewers</li>
              <li>If your brokerage pays, access usually ends when you leave</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
