        <p style="color:var(--bs-accent);font-weight:600;">
          Pricing: No published rate card, quote only via boldtrail.com/pricing (which redirects to a demo request form) · Agent-reported around $499/month solo, setup reported near $999, ad spend billed separately · Team and brokerage quotes reported from $1,200 to $2,500/month · Reviewer-reported plans include $427.50 to $475/month, $1,600/month plus add-ons, and $1,500/month for managed advertising · Terms published without amounts include an implementation fee, monthly communication and AI token fees, and MLS fees billed as incurred · Annual contracts the reported default, no free trial, no free plan (verified on boldtrail.com, Software Advice, Capterra and G2, November 2026; all dollar figures other than the $59 style published prices are third party or reviewer reported and unconfirmed by the vendor)
        </p>
